$ unikraft instance wait --help

stdout:
	Wait for instances to match a filter.

	Usage:
	  unikraft instances wait --until=UNTIL <target> ... [flags]

	Arguments:
	  <target> ...
	          Target instances to wait for.

	Fields:
	  metro
	  name
	  uuid
	  tags
	  state
	  image
	  runtime, runtime.args, runtime.env
	  resources, resources.memory, resources.vcpus
